fixture cam_steer_onto_ledge_late
doc Camera review round 3: falling at terminal speed beside a ledge, Ash steers onto it late (from tick 89) with air control; the ground probe counts what air control could still reach, so the look never reaches past the ledge and the view never comes back up after the landing
room test/cam_steer
spawn 700 200
frames 220
input
  89..103 R
end
expect
  mark land 90..219 event.land=1
  at land y=2240u
end
